  "job_C26.1_20251003_115243": {
    "chunk_text": "Abraham exemplum fideliter credentium fuit Her godes swy\u00f0ra forbead Abrahame, \u00fe\u00e6t he his sunu ne Ubi quinque reges predati sunt Loth Her \u00f0as fif kynegas bereafodon Loth \u00e6t his \u00e6hton. Abram post praedones currit Her Abraham ferde \u00e6fter \u00f0am kynegon, \u00f0e Loth bereafodon. Abram devictis hostibus recepto Loth cum victoria revertitur Her Abraham gewunnenum sige ferde Ubi Abram decimas offert et Melchisedech Habrahae panem et vinum, Melchisedech rex et sacerdos dei Ubi tres angeli apparent Abrahe in convalle Mambre Her \u00e6teowdon \u00f0ry englas Abrahame on \u00f0am dene, Prudentius orat Her Prudentius hine gebitt on naman. Fides secura adhuc belli ignara idolatriam repugnat prima Her se geleafa fiht ongean \u00f0a deofolgyld. Fides conculcat idolatriam. Fides post victoriam virtutes coronat Her se geleafa \u00e6fter gewunnenum sige gewuldorbeaga\u00f0 \u00f0a mihta. Pudicitia contra libidinem armis pugnat Her seo cl\u00e6nnys fiht ongean \u00f0a galnysse. Pudicitia libidinem cum saxo percutit Her seo cl\u00e6nnys wyrp\u00f0 \u00fea galnysse mid stane. Pudicitia libidinem transfigit gladio Her seo cl\u00e6nnys \u00f0urh\u00f0y\u00f0 \u00fea galnysse mid swurde. Pudicitia libidinem extinctam increpat Her seo cl\u00e6nnys \u00f0rea\u00f0 \u00fea adwescedan galnysse. Sancta pudicitia gladium purificat Her seo cl\u00e6nnys a\u00f0woh hyre swurd on \u00f0\u00e6re ea Iordane. Pudicitia gladium suum sub altare in templo recondit Her seo cl\u00e6nnys behyt hyre swurd on",
